            <resourceFormat>
                <MD_Format>
                    <name>
                        <gco:CharacterString>Data Delivery Formats:&#13;
LiDAR Point Cloud&#13;
LAS1.4 PDRF6 Level 3 Classification, tiled data, in both ellipsoidal and AHD (1km x 1km)&#13;
The original las file shows unknown coordinate system in ArcGIS&#13;
Gridded products&#13;
Non-hydroflattened digital elevation model (DEM), tiled in ArcASCII, simple xyz, and GEOTIFF formats (1km x 1km)&#13;
Hydroflattened digital elevation model (DEM), tiled in ArcASCII, simple xyz, and GEOTIFF formats (1km x 1km)&#13;
Non-hydroflattened digital elevation model (DSM), tiled in ArcASCII, simple xyz, and GEOTIFF formats (1km x 1km)&#13;
Hydroflattened digital elevation model (DSM), tiled in ArcASCII, simple xyz, and GEOTIFF formats (1km x 1km)&#13;
Intensity imagery, tiled in ECW format and GEOTIFF (1km x 1km)&#13;
Vector products&#13;
Contours at 25cm intervals, tiled in shapefile format (1km x 1km)&#13;
Trajectories in shapefile format&#13;
Tile definition in shapefile format&#13;
Survey control&#13;
3D Shapefile, imagery, spreadsheets, and subcontractor reporting&#13;
Naming conventions as per project specification.</gco:CharacterString>
